# Verify that tryInsertWaitsAtEntryBlock does not emit redundant waits when
# pre-existing waits at the entry of a non-entry function already cover the
# required counters.

# Pre-GFX12: a pre-existing S_WAITCNT 0 at entry covers all counters.
# The pass should not insert any additional waits.
---
name: test_preexisting_full_coverage_gfx9
machineFunctionInfo:
  isEntryFunction: false
body: |
